    text: "Change\r\nMinor changes to weekday, Saturday, and Sunday/Holiday schedules.\r\n\nReason\r\nImproves on-time performance and service reliability.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 53 respondents, 44% reported a positive impact from the change, 42% indicated it had no impact, and 15% perceived the change negatively.\r\n\nAdditional information about the Downtown Rail Reconstruction Project can be found here: https://www.rtd-denver.com/railproject\r\n"
